```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner --help
Work with the Scherzo Cloud runner

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner [COMMAND]

Commands:
  activation  Manage runner enrollment activations
  create      Create a runner registration and enrollment activation
  credential  Manage runner credential lifecycle
  delete      Delete a quiescent Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  disable     Disable a Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  doctor      Check local runner prerequisites
  drain       Drain a Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  enable      Enable a Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  enroll      Enroll a protected runner credential
  list        List Scherzo Cloud runner registrations
  move        Move a quiescent Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  pool        Manage Scherzo Cloud runner pools
  rename      Rename a Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  serve       Connect to Scherzo Cloud and serve run assignments
  show        Show a Scherzo Cloud runner registration
  status      Show live Runner Serve status
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
